งานวิจัย: Articulating iconic architecture, heritage and public perceptions through digital narratives in Eleftheria Square, Nicosia (2026) https://doi.org/10.1080/09654313.2026.2643007
งานวิจัย: Non-Destructive Techniques for Building Evaluation in Urban Areas: The Case Study of the Redesigning Project of Eleftheria Square (Nicosia, Cyprus) (2020) https://doi.org/10.3390/app10124296
